        public async Task<ReturnListModel<DailyAffirmationSessionCategoryModel>> CreateMultipleDailyAffirmationSessionCategoryAsync(MultipleDailyAffirmationSessionCategoryCreateModel dailyAffirmationSessionCategorys)
